				PRINTFORML 「I was gonna have a hands-on training session on how to divvy up and portion out the loot!」
				PRINTFORMW 「I'm begging you! I'll do it outside, okay! I'll do it outside!!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORML 「I'm sorry, table manners are a little too difficult for these mice.」
				PRINTFORMW 「They just can't help but make a mess.」
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			IF RAND:4 == 0
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORMW 「That Kasodani, she should really clean the rest of the temple, too, not just sweep the main approach...」
			ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORMW 「You're working hard. I appreciate it.」
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORML 「...Wait a minute, there's still a bit of dust on the edge there.」
				PRINTFORML 「There's a leaf in the shadow here, and look, there's a scrap of paper at your feet right there! Not that way! To the right!」
				PRINTFORMW 「Give me that for a second! Right here——In this gap, see!」
				PRINTFORML 
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORMW 「Huh, is it safe to throw out the trash as normal? Why do you ask?」
				PRINTFORML 「...Aah, you mean the mice?」
				PRINTFORML 「The mice here don't try to scavenge in the garbage.」
				PRINTFORML 「Although they wouldn't mind snatching a piece of candy off the floor.」
				PRINTFORMW 「If you drop something, you have to pick it up within the first three seconds or it'll be gone.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORML 「What in the hell... Who dumped all of these bones over here?!」
				PRINTFORML 
				PRINTFORMW 「......Ah, it was one of my mice. There's teeth marks on it.」
				PRINTFORML 
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
