		PRINTFORML 「Oooh... How adorable.」
		PRINTFORMDL Nazrin admires a manjuu artfully sculpted in the shape of a moon rabbit.
		PRINTFORMW 「...Well, rabbit meat would be even better than steamed buns...」
	ELSEIF DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Tsukimi Dango" && TCVAR:TARGET:料理評価値 >= 500
		PRINTFORMDL After tasting one of the freshly pounded tsukimi-mochi, Nazrin's eyes widen in surprise.
		PRINTFORML 「What the... The softness of the dough, the mouthfeel of the sweet bean paste, it's incredible...」
		PRINTFORMW 「As expected, the tsukimi pros are on another level.」
		PRINTFORMDW Calling someone a "tsukimi pro" seems like a bit of an off-the-wall title...
	ELSEIF DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Crimson Blood Soup" && TCVAR:TARGET:料理評価値 >= 500
		PRINTFORML 「Heeh... So it's blood red after all.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Somehow it tastes okay, despite its looks.」
	ELSEIF DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Chocolate Cake" || DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Cake" || DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Cheesecake"
		PRINTFORML 「...This is yet another extravagant dessert...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I think a black tea would pair better with this, instead of green tea.」
	ELSEIF DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Death By Chocolate" || DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Strawberry Special" || DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Royal Jelly" || DISHNAME_TR(DISH_NAME) == "Nectar Jelly"
		PRINTFORML 「Hmm... I think it's a little too sugary...」
		PRINTFORMW 「That said, this might make for a good bargaining chip against Master. She has a big sweet tooth, after all.」
	;end relocated content
	ELSEIF !TASTE_REACTION("辛い") && !TASTE_REACTION("甘い") && !TASTE_REACTION("わさび") && !TASTE_REACTION("すっぱい")
		;414,食事から呼び出された時
		IF SELECTCOM == 414
			SIF TCVAR:TARGET:料理評価値 >= 700
				PRINTFORMDL It seems like %CALLNAME:TARGET% likes the seasoning on this one.
			IF TFLAG:193 == 1
				PRINTFORMDL You and %CALLNAME:TARGET% enjoy a pleasant moment while eating %DISHNAME_TR(DISHNAME)%...
			ELSEIF TFLAG:193 == -1
				PRINTFORMDL ...Seems like it wasn't to %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s taste.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDL %CALLNAME:TARGET% eats the %DISHNAME_TR(DISHNAME)% that you served to her with an air of delight.
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
		;成功
		IF TFLAG:193 == 1
			PRINTFORML 「...! That's actually quite delicious, you're doing great.」
			PRINTFORMW 「You used just the right amount of heat, and the ingredients were chopped to the right size, so it's well-balanced.」
			;好みの味付け
			SIF CFLAG:TARGET:味覚嗜好 & TCVAR:MASTER:308
				PRINTFORMW 「And not to mention it's rather rich. The food I normally eat is a little light for my taste... I love it.」
		;失敗
		ELSEIF TFLAG:193 == -1
				PRINTFORMDL As Nazrin chews her food, a subtle grimace passes over her face.
				IF RAND:5 == 0 
					PRINTFORMW 「It's overcooked...」
				ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0 
					PRINTFORMW 「There's a lump of salt...」
				ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0 
					PRINTFORMW 「It's not cooked all the way...」
				ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0 
					PRINTFORMW 「It's raw...」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW 「...It's burnt...」
				ENDIF
				;好みの味付け
				SIF CFLAG:TARGET:味覚嗜好 & TCVAR:MASTER:308
				PRINTFORMW 「Even though the seasoning is really to my liking... Such a waste.」
		ELSE
			IF RAND:4 == 0 
				PRINTFORMW 「...Umu, that was pretty good. Thank you for the treat.」
			ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORML 「...Wait a minute. There's only cheese on my portion.」
				PRINTFORML 「No, I'm not complaining about the quantity, I'm just asking why you put cheese on just mine...」
				PRINTFORMW 「...And more than that, where the hell did you pull this Grana Padano out of?!」
				PRINTFORML 「Hey, don't grate it! Don't you dare sprinkle it on either!」
				PRINTFORMW 「It'll spill! That would be a waste!」
